  "body": "Accept the figure-eight counterexample to the literal universal rank-two persistent-free-subgroup question in Motegi's OWR8/2020 contribution, p.493. Every rational filling group is infinite, but zero filling is a torus bundle and its metabelian group kills a nontrivial second-derived word in every embedded rank-two free subgroup. The separate search for a positive hyperbolic example remains unresolved. Classical topology and algebra are credited.\n\nPublished research note and verification package: [10.5281/zenodo.23386475](https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23386475). Public metadata match the supplied configuration exactly and both public downloads match the reviewed hashes. Tracker row: `'Math Puzzles'!A97:D97`.\n\nValidation: complete source-supported all-rational hypothesis and universal proof; 22 unchanged original inputs; all seven actual replay jobs under OS network denial with full JSON agreement; ten nested seals; exact PDF/ZIP rebuilds and all four pages inspected. A new comprehensive reviewer found one minor citation locator; it was corrected globally, and a new sequential comprehensive reviewer passed the revised package with zero actionable findings. [Final review](https://github.com/AlecKriebel/Math/blob/01f45b152776b89e0da4933f8a746dc1d911de59/draft_pr_claimed_solved_500_600_20261012/audits/pr582_30004404/reviews/package_preflight02/REPORT.md) and [acceptance record](https://github.com/AlecKriebel/Math/blob/01f45b152776b89e0da4933f8a746dc1d911de59/draft_pr_claimed_solved_500_600_20261012/audits/pr582_30004404/FINAL_PUBLICATION_ACCEPTANCE.json).\n\nPriority cannot be fully cleared: the full 2024 cyclic-persistence and 2019 vanishing-elements bodies were not inspected, and other scoped-reading limits are disclosed. No historical-first, new-topology or continued-open-status claim is made. AI tools were used extensively; this is an unrefereed preprint with internal AI reviews, no human peer review and no proof-assistant certification. Original sealed evidence is preserved; the current publication supplies the corrected inventory gate and citation reconciliation.\n",
